sequenceDiagram
    participant App as 🖥️ Application
    participant WAuth as 📦 WAuth
    participant LD as 💾 LocalDriver
    participant VA as 🗄️ Vault
    participant SQLite as 💿 SQLite
    participant CE as 🔒 CryptoEngine

    App->>WAuth: get("API_KEY")
    WAuth->>LD: get_secret(key)
    LD->>VA: get(key)
    VA->>SQLite: SELECT WHERE key=?
    
    alt Secret Found
        SQLite-->>VA: (encrypted_value, type, ttl, timestamps)
        VA-->>LD: SecretModel
        LD->>CE: decrypt(encrypted_value)
        CE-->>LD: plaintext bytes
        
        alt type == "text"
            LD-->>WAuth: plaintext.decode()
        else type == "file"
            LD-->>WAuth: plaintext (bytes)
        end
        
        WAuth-->>App: secret value
    else Secret Not Found
        SQLite-->>VA: None
        VA-->>LD: (None, None)
        LD-->>WAuth: None
        WAuth-->>App: None
    end
    
    Note over VA: TTL Check: if time.time() - updated_at > ttl, delete